      <h2>Testimonials</h2>
      <p>This website may contain testimonials by users of products and/or services we provide. Testimonials used reflect real-life experiences and opinions, and may not be entirely representative of all users and experiences. We do not claim that all users will have these exact results or experiences and individual results may vary.</p>

      <h2>Google Review Summary</h2>
      <p>The customer review summary shown on our homepage, when available, is generated automatically by Google using artificial intelligence (Gemini) from reviews published on our Google Business Profile. We display the summary exactly as Google provides it, and we do not write, edit, or endorse the summary content. The summary may not reflect the full range of customer experiences, and its availability depends on Google and is not guaranteed. Google&apos;s review summary is subject to the <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">Google Terms of Service</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        K &amp; D Auto Electric, Inc.<br />
        212 Forward Boulevard<br />
        Somerset, PA 15501<br />
        (814) 443-3615
      </p>
    </div>
